Parakeet Redux is a 1.58-bit packed ternary version of NVIDIA's
parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3 speech recognition model. Nexus did not modify the
weights. The checkpoint is read as safetensors data by Moondream's Photon
runtime; Nexus does not unpack or rebuild the weights.

